sequenceDiagram
    participant SO as Source Owner
    participant LS as Landing Store
    participant QG as Quality Gate
    participant RO as Report Owner
    participant DO as Decision Owner
    participant ES as Evidence Store

    SO->>LS: Submit extract before cut off
    LS->>ES: Record checksum and timestamps
    LS->>QG: Provide immutable extract
    QG->>QG: Run schema, key and business checks
    QG->>ES: Store quality result
    alt Material blocker found
        QG-->>RO: Reject publication and route exceptions
        RO-->>SO: Request correction
        SO->>LS: Submit corrected extract
    else Ready or accepted caveat
        QG-->>RO: Issue readiness result
        RO->>ES: Record approval and report version
        RO->>DO: Publish governed review output
        DO->>ES: Record decisions, actions and due dates
    end
